SITM Database and Notifications Upgrade
	•	Upgrade the static project to the full-stack database-enabled template.
	•	Confirm the full-stack scaffold and existing public pages remain intact.
	•	Define and add the persistent notification schema and migration.
	•	Add server database helpers and tRPC procedures for listing, creating, and marking notifications read.
	•	Add the authenticated notification UI without changing the public-facing site design.
	•	Verify database persistence, auth boundaries, unread counts, and error states.
	•	Save a checkpoint and deliver the upgraded project.

Scope assumptions
The notification system will be an authenticated, database-backed in-app notification center for signed-in members. Existing public content and the embedded Rostr job board will remain unchanged. No seed or test customer data will be inserted.

Open decision
	•	Confirm whether notifications should be user-created/admin-created from an internal panel, or only generated by defined website events such as new job-board/news announcements.

